[gd_scene format=3]

; The Ashfall, east of the Slag (map offset (261, -126)): a pit under a broken flue, ash raining through the hole where
; the flue fell in. From the Slag's door a stair of ledges zig-zags down to the ash floor. East, behind a curtain of heat
; rising from the floor grates, the low door to the Pyre (Heat plating); in the floor, a hatch down to the Bellows.

